### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### List seeded documents
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents

### Re-run seed (needs GROQ_API_KEY)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents/seed

### Semantic search
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "how do I take vacation days?",
  "limit": 3
}

### Ask with retrieved context
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What does the Growth plan include?",
  "limit": 3
}

### Add a document
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Keyboard shortcuts",
  "content": "Press C to create an issue, / to search, and G then B to open the current board.",
  "metadata": {
    "topic": "product"
  }
}
